lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8305, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018rX8rKotgZC4kp4eByRGKb", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10236, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01L8veNUCd9n5y7w2F7Sr7sC", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10536, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01L8veNUCd9n5y7w2F7Sr7sC", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10536, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01L8veNUCd9n5y7w2F7Sr7sC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13088, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AbM8bC8EA6KsdhwJSwzDA8", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17088, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AbM8bC8EA6KsdhwJSwzDA8", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17088, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AbM8bC8EA6KsdhwJSwzDA8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18990, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BpvFgqUozDFRaeVwwU3kGu", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19290, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BpvFgqUozDFRaeVwwU3kGu", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19290, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BpvFgqUozDFRaeVwwU3kGu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19290, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AbZdptejLWsB6zudVchXXz", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19590, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AbZdptejLWsB6zudVchXXz", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19590, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AbZdptejLWsB6zudVchXXz", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24275, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0177Bn8cf5brrzr7RvX5jvmP", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of ~18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0; us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollout. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54875, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0177Bn8cf5brrzr7RvX5jvmP", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54875, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0177Bn8cf5brrzr7RvX5jvmP", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56526, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KEvPxz9DZmUgRGnxQMzLPu", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 56826, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KEvPxz9DZmUgRGnxQMzLPu", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56826, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KEvPxz9DZmUgRGnxQMzLPu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 61569, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and opened a SEV2 incident (INC-0001). The service is healthy again.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring. Its release candidate had also failed in staging.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. It had been healthy before, so it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- The first attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I retried once and it finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had already been created, so there's no duplicate and the on-call engineer was paged only once.\n- INC-0001 is open and covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RH8rBfmL3iJqjv7f4EpSNx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01L4sAht4ixHKHkf1GDEEh8R", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018rX8rKotgZC4kp4eByRGKb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01L8veNUCd9n5y7w2F7Sr7sC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only finished in us-east. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AbM8bC8EA6KsdhwJSwzDA8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BpvFgqUozDFRaeVwwU3kGu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AbZdptejLWsB6zudVchXXz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0177Bn8cf5brrzr7RvX5jvmP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of ~18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0; us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollout. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01KEvPxz9DZmUgRGnxQMzLPu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and opened a SEV2 incident (INC-0001). The service is healthy again.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring. Its release candidate had also failed in staging.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. It had been healthy before, so it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- The first attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I retried once and it finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had already been created, so there's no duplicate and the on-call engineer was paged only once.\n- INC-0001 is open and covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}